    "detailed_description": "Step into the realm of Creative Continents, where we flip the script on gaming. Here, it's not just about playing a game; it's about making it your own. Born from a desire to hand over the developer's canvas to you, the players, this game is your gateway to crafting worlds that are truly yours.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImagine having the tools that once only game developers wielded. Picture yourself molding landscapes, tweaking terrains with 50 types of land to choose from, and dotting the environment with a kaleidoscope of foliage that springs from your imagination. That's what Creative Continents brings to your gaming table \u2013 a chance to create, not just consume.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDive into your custom world with a third-person view that makes the adventure even more personal. Bring friends into the mix with Steam Multiplayer, and watch as your collective creativity comes to life. Here, the only limit is what you can dream up.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe kicked off Creative Continents with a simple yet powerful goal: to empower you with the creative freedoms that developers enjoy. It's a commitment to keep pushing the envelope with each update, ensuring your journey in digital world-building is as limitless as it is thrilling.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready to embrace a gaming experience that's evolving with you and for you. Your worlds await in Creative Continents \u2013 where your vision is the blueprint, and every update is a new door to endless possibilities.",
    "about_the_game": "Step into the realm of Creative Continents, where we flip the script on gaming. Here, it's not just about playing a game; it's about making it your own. Born from a desire to hand over the developer's canvas to you, the players, this game is your gateway to crafting worlds that are truly yours.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImagine having the tools that once only game developers wielded. Picture yourself molding landscapes, tweaking terrains with 50 types of land to choose from, and dotting the environment with a kaleidoscope of foliage that springs from your imagination. That's what Creative Continents brings to your gaming table \u2013 a chance to create, not just consume.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDive into your custom world with a third-person view that makes the adventure even more personal. Bring friends into the mix with Steam Multiplayer, and watch as your collective creativity comes to life. Here, the only limit is what you can dream up.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe kicked off Creative Continents with a simple yet powerful goal: to empower you with the creative freedoms that developers enjoy. It's a commitment to keep pushing the envelope with each update, ensuring your journey in digital world-building is as limitless as it is thrilling.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready to embrace a gaming experience that's evolving with you and for you. Your worlds await in Creative Continents \u2013 where your vision is the blueprint, and every update is a new door to endless possibilities.",
    "short_description": "Creative Continents: A sandbox world-builder where you wield the tools of game devs. Carve, construct, and explore your creations with friends in a dynamic, player-shaped universe. Your adventure, your rules. &quot;Mold the Worlds you play in.&quot;",
